  {
   "id": "big-trouble-in-little-chimney-327122@1.3",
   "gameId": "big-trouble-in-little-chimney-327122",
   "displayName": "UPDATE 1.3",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2024-11-30T12:30:12.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Ho Ho Ho!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Here's a new update v 1.3 with some important changes that will improve gameplay:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Added: Option to On/Off Flashing VFX.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Bazooka, Grenade Launcher and other explosive weapons are now eyes friendly :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Added: A small HP bar above the Gingerbread (mid-boss) head.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Added/Changed: HP for Elf. Surprise! Yes, Elf is now mortal.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Don't be too much greedy, don't shoot at him non-stop. Elf is not Your enemy!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "(btw Elf spawn every 30 sec.)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Changed: Stopped spawning the Christmas Elf during the boss battle with Krampus.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "If there was an Elf there, it was harder to target the boss with Auto-Aim.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-A few minor bugs and issues fixed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "ps. Still working on the SteamDeck controls problem. I hope i'll fix it soon.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Have fun, folks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "@FobTi",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
